WEBVTT

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:01.393
more death-courageous,

00:04:01.417 --> 00:04:03.500
just more fearful.

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:06.601
We're far too sad,

00:04:06.625 --> 00:04:09.268
too frightened of our own death.

00:04:09.292 --> 00:04:13.518
Our conception of death
has narrowed to an I-thing,

00:04:13.542 --> 00:04:16.351
never an our-thing.

00:04:16.375 --> 00:04:22.934
The terminally ill are often ashamed
of their sickening and hide from sight.

00:04:22.958 --> 00:04:26.601
We are embarrassed
about what to say to a colleague

00:04:26.625 --> 00:04:28.809
who's lost someone they love.

00:04:28.833 --> 00:04:31.643
Embarrassed by our mortality.